BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260725T150000Z
DTEND:20260726T220000Z
DTSTAMP:20260904T190726Z
UID:77363-1784973600-1785085200@ccs-houston.com
CREATED:20260711T204517Z
DESCRIPTION:🚗🏁 Houston World of Hot Wheels IV is roaring back with more t
 hrills and speed! 🏁🚗\nAfter an electric\, action-packed weekend of nonsto
 p deals\, racing\, and collector excitement\, Houston World of Hot Wheels I
 V is revving up for another round! We’re bringing even MORE vendors\, MORE 
 cars\, and MORE action for collectors\, racers\, and families to enjoy all 
 weekend long. ⚡ \n  \n📅 July 25–26\, 2026 | 10AM–5PM\n📍 9700 Bissonnet St
  1500\, Houston\, TX\n🎟️ FREE Entry + FREE Parking \n  \nEvent Highlights\
 n🛒 Hot Wheels Swap & Shop – Both Days \n50+ vendors. 30\,000+ Hot Wheels\,
  Matchbox\, and diecast to dig through. STHs\, TH variations\, premium Car 
 Culture\, redline-era pieces\, MOC vintage\, loose mainline bins\, M2s\, Gr
 eenlights\, Johnny Lightnings. Bring your want list! \n🚗✨ Houston Diecast 
 Custom Contest – 10AM-3PM | Both Days \nCalling all builders and custom kin
 gs 👑 Bring your best custom Hot Wheels/Matchbox build — paint\, wheel swap
 s\, stance\, body kits\, full one-of-one creations. This contest is for the
  detail freaks and the true “trust the process” customizers. 🏆 The winner 
 will be announced at 4PM and will receive a prize sponsored by Domingo! ✨ H
 osted by @funopolistoys \n🏁 Hot Wheels Racing Contest – Both Days\nThe sta
 ge track is live all weekend. Hourly races\, prizes for winners\, FREE to e
 nter. Saturday at 12PM\, 2PM\, and 4PM. Sunday Every hour from 11AM – 4PM. 
 ✨ Hosted by Kool Kids \n👶 Mini Zones & Family Fun\nFun spaces for younger 
 collectors and first‑time racers — all ages welcome! \n  \n🚨 VENDORS WANTE
 D\nGot STHs\, vintage redlines\, custom builds\, or bulk mainline to move? 
 This is your crowd.\n📥 Apply: https://tinyurl.com/CCSGuestVendorFromHousto
 n \n  \n🏨 Special Hotel Deals\nEnjoy a special room rate of $79/night at T
 ownePlace Suites\, just about 15 minutes from the venue!\n👉 Book: https://
 www.marriott.com/event-reservations/reservation-link.mi?id=1767823967549&ke
 y=CORP&app=resvlink \n  \nHunt or race. Trade or just walk the floor. The c
 ustoms will be parked outside\, the bins will be open inside\, and the trac
 k will be running all weekend. See you July 25–26.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260711T204518Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Houston World of Hot Wheels IV
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
