CREATED:20260904T043211Z
DESCRIPTION:We are so excited to announce that our Annual Gala will be held
  on Saturday\, September 12\, 2026 at the Great Wolf Lodge!\nOur Thorns to 
 Triumph Experience is an event you won’t want to miss. There will be lots o
 f new and exciting things to enjoy\, along with some of your favorite highl
 ights from past years.\n\nThis year\, during the Thorns to Triumph Experien
 ce\, you will also hear from a panel of speakers who have first-hand knowle
 dge of Kidz Harbor and will share their personal experiences over the years
 .\n\nFor more information on becoming a sponsor or purchasing an individual
  ticket\, please follow this link:\nhttps://onecau.se/_hhgnx1
LAST-MODIFIED:20260904T043211Z
